 "text": "Hi, how are you today? That's lot of bike and lot of kids. Do you have team that helps with stopping at stops? Sure, take your time. So, is there movement outside the tent, or did you hear something else? Then it is worth checking it is yours, and if it' used, whose turn is it next. If you haven't used it for a while, and it' yours, a minor maintenance check. If nobody has used it in while, and it' not yours, pick up the tent and carry it, and go inside.",
